s. Duration: 100 minutes Rating: 15 Director: Francesco Sossai Cast: Filippo Scotti, Sergio Romano, Pierpaolo Capovilla Year: 2025 Language: Italian Subtitles: English https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=970EvAbQ3qI</div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/LeqDZMaZJW_u7LUUDZcptFrAaCkcyXa46CZ7fKRC2Io/rs:fit:1920:800:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTI1Ml9vcmlnLmpwZw\" alt=\"The Last One for the Road\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                                        \n\n                                        \n\n                                                        </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_161\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_7\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_5\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_90\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_9\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_226\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_227\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_10\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_8\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_223\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_114\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_11\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    \n\n    <aside class=\"section section--suggestions container-fluid suggestionWrapper  varia