n    <div class=\"inner\">\n        <section class=\"column\">\n                            &copy; JW3\n                    </section>\n\n                    <p>JW3 Trust Ltd is a registered charity, No. 1117644. | JW3 Trading Ltd, registered company No. 7686352 (England and Wales), is a wholly owned subsidiary of JW3 Trust Ltd.</p>\n        \n                    <section class=\"column powered-by\">\n                Powered by <a href=\"https://www.culturesuite.co/\" rel=\"external\">CultureSuite</a>\n            </section>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\n            </footer>\n        </div>\n\n\n                \n                \n\n\n\n                \n    <aside  id=\"cookie-consent-banner\" class=\"cookieConsentBanner\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        <div class=\"cookieConsentForm\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n            <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n                <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"content\">\n                        <p>\n                                                            We use cookies and similar techniques to analyze the use of the website, to make it possible to display third-party content such as videos, and for various other applications. These cookies are also placed by third parties.\n                            \n                                                            <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"#more-cookiebanner\">More information&hellip;</a>\n                                                    </p>\n                                                    <div class=\"more\" id=\"more-cookiebanner\">\n                                <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                    <fieldset class=\"buttons\">\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                                    Only functional cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                                    Minimal cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                                    All cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </fieldset>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n\n                                <div data-controller=\"modal\" data-action=\"modal:open@window->modal#open\" data-modal-id-value=\"waitinglistModal\">\n        <dialog id=\"waitinglistModal\" class=\"generic-modal waitinglist\" data-