          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"How to Live on Earth is a visionary feature documentary that explores our vital connection to nature and its role in our future. Presented by Benedict Cumberbatch, this ultimate 'how-to guide' features inspirational, cutting-edge stories and powerful cinematography from around the world to reveal how humans are learning to team up with nature to solve our biggest challenges. Heart-warming, entertaining, energising, the film presents a hopeful vision of a future within reach – one in which nature thrives, and so do we. Duration: 95 minutes Rating: 12A Director: Fredi Devas Cast: Benedict Cumberbatch, Xiye Bastida, Sam Kass Year: 2026 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Be4Y2gJONSQ\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 96,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"How to Live on Earth\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"21 July-6 August\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"642001AQJSLDCMLPLRVLLNKLJKDTLVDGR\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-07-21T15:50:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-07-21T14:50:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-06T16:50:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-06T15:50:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"149401ALSPNQKBLRBDJBKVKJLTNBBJLMB\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"642001AQJSLDCMLPLRVLLNKLJKDTLVDGR\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-08-06T16:50:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-08-06T15:50:00\",\n      \"startSellin