            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"A young girl, Sophia (Emily Matthews) spends the summer with her father (Anders Danielsen Lie) and grandmother (Glenn Close) on a small island in the Gulf of Finland, as the family grapples with the recent death of Sophia's mother. Duration: 81 minutes\\r\\nRating: PG\\r\\nDirector: Charlie McDowell\\r\\nCast:  Emily Matthew, Glenn Close, Anders Danielsen Lie\\r\\nYear:2026 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_ZfIALnLZnI\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 95,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"The Summer Book\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"7 August-20 August\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"657401ATMCLSKBSNCKNQDJRGCVBJMRBDP\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-07T15:40:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-07T14:40:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-20T14:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-20T13:00:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"178001AKCHMSVPVQMCBCVCMQMLGKNPCKR\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"657401ATMCLSKBSNCKNQDJRGCVBJMRBDP\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-08-07T15:40:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-08-07T14:40:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-07-23T13:09:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-07-23T12:09:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-08-07T15:40:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-08-07T14:40:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\": false,\