5.018 -8.002,-29.319 -23.403,-29.319l-392.782,0l-9.166,-44.81c-2.284,-11.169 -12.112,-19.19 -23.513,-19.19l-102.529,0c-13.255,0 -24,10.745 -24,24l0,16c0,13.255 10.745,24 24,24l69.883,0l70.248,343.435c-16.806,9.665 -28.131,27.787 -28.131,48.565c0,30.928 25.072,56 56,56c30.928,0 56,-25.072 56,-56c0,-15.674 -6.447,-29.835 -16.824,-40l209.647,0c-10.376,10.165 -16.823,24.326 -16.823,40c0,30.928 25.072,56 56,56c30.928,0 56,-25.072 56,-56c0,-22.172 -12.888,-41.332 -31.579,-50.405l5.517,-24.276c3.413,-15.018 -8.002,-29.319 -23.403,-29.319l-268.418,0l-6.545,-32l293.145,0c11.206,0 20.92,-7.754 23.403,-18.681Z'/></g></svg></span>\n                    <span class='label'><span class='label'><span class=\"movie-time-start\">5:00 PM</span><span class='screenreader'>Tickets</span></span></span>\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n</li>\n\n        \n        \n                    <li class=\"subshow type-info cost-message\">\n                <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. </p>\n            </li>\n        \n                    </ul>\n\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p>The Bride of Belsen tells the extraordinary story of Gena Turgel MBE.&nbsp;</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                \n    <aside  class=\"cookieConsentPlaceholder\">\n        <div class=\"cookieConsentForm\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n            <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n                <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"content\">\n                        <p>\n                                                            We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                            \n                                                            <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"#more-page_part_3\">More information&hellip;</a>\n                                                    </p>\n                                                    <div class=\"more\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                                <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                    <fieldset class=\"buttons\">\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                                    Only functional cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                                    Minimal cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                                    All cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </fieldset>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                            \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p>The youngest of nine children, she survived four Nazi concentration camps. Having walked out of the gas chambers at Auschwitz concentration camp alive, she remained by her mother&rsquo;s side, doing everything she could to keep her alive. She was liberated in 1945 by British soldier Norman Turgel.</p>\n<p>Their love story captured the world&rsquo;s imagination when they married just months later, Gena in a wedding dress made from a British parachute, now preserved at the Imperial War Museum. Known as &ldquo;The Bride of Belsen&rdquo;, she became one of the most recognised voices of Holocaust education, sharing her testimony with hundreds of thousands and earning an MBE for her service. Told in her own voice, with spellbinding imagery and a powerful soundtrack, this is her testimony.&nbsp;</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>60 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                    <dt>Language</dt>\n                                    <dd>English</dd>\n                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>&pound;9 / &pound;15</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                        \n\n                                        \n\n                                                        </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_161\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_7\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_5\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_90\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_9\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_226\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\