            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"Lady Isabella, aspires to be in the spotlight, and local talent show 'Stately Stars' provides her a break. However, high pressures and a loss of self lead to a surreal situation on her grand estate. Duration: 81 minutes\\r\\nRating:15\\r\\nDirector: Samuel Abrahams\\r\\nCast: Sian Clifford, Juliet Cowan, Laurie Kynaston\\r\\nYear: 2025 LADY | Official Trai https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MuJHJTK0Pmg ler | MetFilm\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 95,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Lady\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"14 August-24 August\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"656801AJRRBGSJDQRMMQLBJMHVRNTBGKC\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-14T15:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-14T14:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-24T19:15:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-24T18:15:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n      \"event\": {\n        \"id\": \"656801AJRRBGSJDQRMMQLBJMHVRNTBGKC\"\n      },\n      \"start\": \"2026-08-14T15:00:00\",\n      \"startUtc\": \"2026-08-14T14:00:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-07-23T12:34:00\",\n      \"startSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-07-23T11:34:00Z\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWeb\": \"2026-08-14T15:00:00\",\n      \"stopSellingAtWebUtc\": \"2026-08-14T14:00:00Z\",\n      \"webInstanceId\": null,\n      \"cancelled\": false,\n      \"id\":