 class=\"start\">\n                6:00 PM\n            </span>\n\n                                            <span class=\"separator\">\n                    -\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"end\">\n                    9:00 PM\n                </span>\n                    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n                                                                            \n                                    \n                <a class='btn btn-active btn-order status-normaal'\n                    href='/spektrix/ChooseSeats?EventInstanceId=1089801ABKRBKMPLGPGVVVPJBLLTRDLNH'\n                    rel='external'>\n                    <span class='peppered-icon icon-cart' aria-hidden='true'><svg version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink' x='0px' y='0px' width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 20 20' xml:space='preserve'><g transform='matrix(0.0347222,0,0,0.0347222,0,1.11111)'><path d='M528.12,301.319l47.273,-208c3.413,-15.018 -8.002,-29.319 -23.403,-29.319l-392.782,0l-9.166,-44.81c-2.284,-11.169 -12.112,-19.19 -23.513,-19.19l-102.529,0c-13.255,0 -24,10.745 -24,24l0,16c0,13.255 10.745,24 24,24l69.883,0l70.248,343.435c-16.806,9.665 -28.131,27.787 -28.131,48.565c0,30.928 25.072,56 56,56c30.928,0 56,-25.072 56,-56c0,-15.674 -6.447,-29.835 -16.824,-40l209.647,0c-10.376,10.165 -16.823,24.326 -16.823,40c0,30.928 25.072,56 56,56c30.928,0 56,-25.072 56,-56c0,-22.172 -12.888,-41.332 -31.579,-50.405l5.517,-24.276c3.413,-15.018 -8.002,-29.319 -23.403,-29.319l-268.418,0l-6.545,-32l293.145,0c11.206,0 20.92,-7.754 23.403,-18.681Z'/></g></svg></span>\n                    <span class='label'><span class='label'>Tickets</span></span>\n                </a>\n\n                                                            \n                                            </div>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n                                \n            <div>\n                <div id=\"show317Dates\" class=\"subshows \" >\n                    <div class=\"foldout movie\">\n                            <ul>\n        <li class=\"subshow type-info cost-message\">\n            <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. </p>\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p>From the Coen Brothers, A Serious Man follows Larry Gopnik as he seeks advice from three rabbis to cope with his family life.</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    <div class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                \n    <aside  class=\"cookieConsentPlaceholder\">\n        <div class=\"cookieConsentForm\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n            <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n                <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n                    <div class=\"content\">\n                        <p>\n                                                            We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                            \n                                                            <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"#more-page_part_3\">More information&hellip;</a>\n                                                    </p>\n                                                    <div class=\"more\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                                <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                    <fieldset class=\"buttons\">\n                        <ul>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                                    Only functional cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                                    Minimal cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>\n                                <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                                    All cookies\n                                </button>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </fieldset>\n                </div>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                                                                    \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p>With a filmed introduction by Richard Kind and in-conversation with Dr Julia Wagner and journalist Darren Richman, this is set to be a very special screening.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/TXz5r7uIJ2onGDlkIO65hTfvbD-4yHXOlYif78Io4bk/rs:fit:1920:800:1/format:png/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTIzM19vcmlnLnBuZw\" alt=\"A Serious Man\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                    <dt>Direction</dt>\n                                    <dd>Ethan Coen and Joel Coen</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Cast</dt>\n                                    <dd>Michael Stuhlbarg, Richard Kind, Sari Lennick</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>106 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>&pound;16.50</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                                                <div class=\"partof\">\n                                                                                        Part of<br>\n                                                        <ul>\n                                                                    <li>\n                                                                                                                        <a href=\"/theme/coming-of-age-film-season-bcdv\">\n                                            <span class='peppered-icon icon-arrow-right' aria-hidden='true'><svg version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink' x='0px' y='0px' width='20' height='20' viewBox='0 0 20 20' xml:space='preserve'><g transform='matrix(1,0,0,1,-220.399,9319.24)'><path style='fill: currentColor; fill-rule:nonzero;' d='M232.035,-9304.29C231.651,-9304.68 231.651,-9305.31 232.035,-9305.7L234.572,-9308.24L225.4,-9308.24C224.851,-9308.24 224.4,-9308.69 224.4,-9309.24C224.4,-9309.79 224.851,-9310.24 225.4,-9310.24L234.578,-9310.24L232.043,-9312.77C231.657,-9313.16 231.657,-9313.8 232.043,-9314.19C232.431,-9314.57 233.068,-9314.57 233.456,-9314.19L237.694,-9309.94C238.082,-9309.56 238.082,-9308.92 237.694,-9308.53L233.451,-9304.29C233.263,-9304.1 233.008,-9303.99 232.742,-9303.99C232.476,-9304 232.221,-9304.1 232.035,-9304.29Z'/></g></svg></span>\n    