          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"description\": \"The film centers on Andrew Dyer (Bill Nighy), a world-famous but emotionally distant novelist who lives with his youngest son, Andy (Noah Jupe), and their housekeeper. Dyer is largely reclusive, spending most of his time in his writing studio, disconnected from his family, and communicating with fans through emails that are secretly ghostwritten by his agent.\\r\\nWhen Dyer summons his estranged older sons, Richard (Johnny Flynn) and Jamie (George MacKay), to his country manor, he reveals a startling secret involving their teenage half-brother Andy. This gathering forces the family to confront long-standing tensions, misunderstandings, and the consequences of Dyer’s neglectful behavior . Duration: 120 minutes\\r\\nRating: 15\\r\\nDirector: Pablo Trapero\\r\\nCast:  Bill Nighy, Dominic West, George MacKay\\r\\nYear: 2026 https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uyAStwAa2Kg\",\n  \"htmlDescription\": \"<div id>\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\",\n  \"duration\": 120,\n  \"imageUrl\": \"\",\n  \"isOnSale\": true,\n  \"name\": \"Babykino: & Sons\",\n  \"instanceDates\": \"24 August-24 August\",\n  \"thumbnailUrl\": \"\",\n  \"webEventId\": null,\n  \"id\": \"655801AHHGPDDPTKHRSDVNSQGKDGSHVSL\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-24T11:00:00\",\n  \"firstInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-24T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTime\": \"2026-08-24T11:00:00\",\n  \"lastInstanceDateTimeUtc\": \"2026-08-24T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"altText\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_CinemaMembershipExclusion\": false,\n  \"attribute_Genre\": \"Cinema\",\n  \"attribute_Language\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TessituraId\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesOrFestival\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_GatedEventFree\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_SeriesBooking\": \"\",\n  \"attribute_TeacherOrLecturer\": \"\",\n  \"instances\": [\n    {\n      \"isOnSale\": true,\n      \"planId\": \"4401APLLPBSHLDJVTLGBDQTQBHJDJSHCM\",\n      \"priceList\": {\n        \"id\": \"148802AKTKTJGVTJVDRDBTJLHNRDTSPJP\"\n      },\n  